# Visit notifications.
#
# The Telegram credentials do NOT live here. They belong to the shared
# portfolio-notifier service, which every portfolio posts to. This project only
# needs to know where that service is, and it already has a working default
# baked in - so nothing has to be set for notifications to work.
#
# Set this only to aim somewhere else, e.g. a local notifier while developing:
#
#   VITE_NOTIFY_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/notify
#
# Vite bakes VITE_* values in at build time, so a change here needs a rebuild.
# Note the browser skips the ping entirely in dev (npm run dev); use
# `npm run build && npm run preview` to exercise it locally.

# VITE_NOTIFY_URL=
